.obsidian

# Source documents stay local — too large, copyright-sensitive, and
# usually retrievable from arxiv/blogs by URL. The wiki page records
# `source_path` and the arxiv/DOI link; that's enough to find the
# original. Subdirectory structure (papers/, lectures/, clips/,
# knowledge-sharings/, scratch/) is tracked via .gitkeep.
raw/**
!raw/
!raw/papers/
!raw/lectures/
!raw/clips/
!raw/knowledge-sharings/
!raw/scratch/
!raw/**/.gitkeep

# Planning artefacts (writing-plans / brainstorming output) stay local.
# Specs and plans are working memory, not deliverables; they accumulate
# fast and would dilute the wiki's commit history.
docs/

# Proposed-but-not-yet-applied skill updates. The skill-updater writes
# a diff here; the user reviews; the skill applies and deletes. Drafts
# never enter the repo history. Only the empty directory is tracked.
.claude/proposed-changes/*
!.claude/proposed-changes/.gitkeep
